"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"run.bat" execute the Filter application from the jar
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"Filter.class" Filter main Java program compiled byte code
"filter.manual.html" detailed HTML manual for the Filter project
"filter.jar" jarred class files: collection of FilenameFilters
"filter.look" uncommented jar manifest
"filter.jnlp" filter jnlp Java Web Start launch
"filter-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"filter.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"filter.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"filter.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"filter.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"filter.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"filter.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_filter.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_filter.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Filter project files
"filter.use" precis(summary) collection of FilenameFilters Generated
"filter.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"filter.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"filter.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"filter.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Filter project
"filter.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Filter project
"filter.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Filter project
"filter.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Filter project
"filter.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Filter project
"filter.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Filter project
"filter.splash.gif" splash gif for the Filter project
"filter.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the Filter project
"filter.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the Filter project
"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for Filter, with one line descriptions.
"use.txt" key facts about the Filter project. Generates filter.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the Filter project. Generates filter.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the Filter project. Generates filter.use
"filter.txt" ASCII text manual for the Filter project.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for Filter
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for Filter
"forgather.xml" list of extra gather steps for ANT.
"forjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in filter.jar
"forjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in filter.jar
"forpost.xml" list of extra posting steps for ANT.
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in filter27.zip
"filter.xml" ASP PAD desc of the Filter project: collection of FilenameFilters
"filter27.zip" Filter 2.7 distribute zip: collection of FilenameFilters
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for filter27.zip
